# Oracul: what never goes into an image. A small build context is sent fast, and changes to tests, specs, docs or the
# E2E package do not invalidate the image layers (stack.mjs skips the rebuild when the image inputs are unchanged).
.git
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.angular
**/dist
**/coverage
backend/build
backend/.gradle
backend/src/test
frontend/src/**/*.spec.ts
e2e
docs
.oracul
**/*.md
